theme/static_src/node_modules/
# theme/static/css/dist/styles.css is committed on purpose: the production
# host's /tmp is noexec, which breaks the Bun-based standalone tailwindcss
# binary at build time. Build it locally with `python manage.py tailwind
# build` and commit the result instead of building on the server.

